    slug: `introducing-the-kawai-master-series-upright-pianos`,
    title: `Introducing the Kawai Master Series Upright Pianos`,
    datePosted: `February 4, 2026`,
    content: `News / Introducing the Kawai Master Series Upright Pianos

Premium Acoustic Performance, Redefined Kawai is proud to announce the launch of the Kawai Master Series upright pianos, a new line of premium acoustic upright pianos designed to represent the highest level of Kawai upright craftsmanship. Featuring three models—the MS-123, MS-130, and MS-134—the Master Series is built for pianists who seek authentic touch, expressive tone, and long-term musical value. Rather than focusing on luxury aesthetics alone, the Master Series emphasizes the true fundamentals of an exceptional upright piano: control, tonal depth, structural integrity, and reliability.

A New Standard in Premium Upright Piano Design Each Kawai Master Series upright piano is built around Kawai's acclaimed Millennium III upright action, incorporating ABS-Carbon composite materials for increased strength, stability, and precision. Combined with a solid spruce soundboard and an enhanced frame and back structure, the Master Series delivers improved tonal flexibility, richer bass response, and consistent performance across a wide dynamic range. Exclusive hammer felts and hand-wound bass strings inspired by Shigeru Kawai grand pianos help define the warm, richly colored Kawai sound, while the inclusion of a sostenuto pedal across the series expands expressive and performance possibilities rarely found in upright pianos.

The Master Series Lineup: Three Models, One Philosophy The Master Series lineup is designed to serve a wide range of pianists and environments, while maintaining a consistent level of craftsmanship and acoustic integrity. MS-123 Introduces the Master Series experience in a slightly more compact design ideal for homes, studios, and educational settings. Height: 123 cm (48") / Width: 153 cm (60") / Depth: 63 cm (25") MS-130 Serves as the core reference model of the series, offering a balanced combination of size, tonal depth, and expressive control for serious pianists. Height: 130 cm (51") / Width: 153 cm (60") / Depth: 64 cm (25") MS-134 The flagship model, delivers grand-inspired projection, power, and presence in a commanding upright form, well suited for performance spaces and institutions. Height: 134 cm (53") / Width: 156 cm (61.5") / Depth: 66 cm (26")

Discover the Master Series With the introduction of the MS-123, MS-130, and MS-134, the Kawai Master Series sets a new benchmark for what a modern acoustic upright piano can achieve. Combining expressive tone, refined touch, and enduring craftsmanship, the Master Series is designed to become an instrumental part of musicians' lives. Explore the Master Series Find a Kawai Dealer Near You`,
